msgid "Exercises"
msgstr "练习"

msgid "Many of these exercises are taken from past exams of ECE 244 Programming Fundamentals courses at University of Toronto. The solutions are provided in the answer boxes."
msgstr "这些练习中有许多来自多伦多大学 ECE 244 Programming Fundamentals 课程的往年考试。答案在答案框中给出。"

msgid "Headings in this page classify the exercises into different categories: **[Easy]**, **[Intermediate]**, and **[Challenging]**. I suggest you start by easy exercises and work your way up to the challenging ones."
msgstr "本页的标题将练习分为不同的难度：**[Easy]**（简单）、**[Intermediate]**（中等）和 **[Challenging]**（困难）。建议你从简单的练习开始，逐步挑战更难的题目。"

